WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
I'm not looking for your son

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,480
The one I have been following is Zhong Lu

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,240
The ghost has a lot of yin energy and resentment

4
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:06,440
The child is weak

5
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:07,680
You'll get sick if you're surrounded

6
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:08,720
It'll be fine as soon as he leaves

7
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:09,920
I don't want money

8
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:11,200
I want 50 gold ingots

9
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,520
There is also a paper house

10
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:13,840
I need a place to stay

11
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:14,800
Serve errands for locals

12
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,200
It's like betraying his cause and effect

13
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,040
Collecting money is to minimize the cause and effect

14
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:19,680
This 5,000 is collected based on the gift.

15
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:20,880
What about the remaining money?

16
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:21,800
the rest

17
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:22,760
I'll do it for their mother

18
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:23,960
Sent to temple for salvation

19
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:27,110
He divorced Zhong Lu and the child belongs to him

20
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,990
Zhong Lu is out of the house in good spirits and his son is fine too

21
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:30,110
No more illness

22
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:32,080
What about Zhong Lu?

23
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:36,730
How else can I make it myself?

24
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:38,330
Old Liu, take the kitchen knife

25
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:39,330
Someone is playing tricks on me

26
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:40,490
little iron master

27
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:42,610
I kind of let myself go after my divorce.

28
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:44,410
From then on, the lower body was raised

29
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:46,210
I went to many hospitals but couldn't find anything.

30
00:00:46,210 --> 00:00:47,610
I am awakened as soon as I fall asleep

31
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:49,130
Sleep for up to three hours

32
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:50,760
I can't see it

33
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:52,120
it's your mistake

34
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,630
than should bear

35
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:55,150
When will the atonement be completed?

36
00:00:55,150 --> 00:00:56,630
When will this strange disease be cured?

37
00:00:56,630 --> 00:00:57,620
Master Liu

38
00:00:57,620 --> 00:00:59,610
Any amount is fine

39
00:00:59,610 --> 00:01:01,010
If money works

40
00:01:01,010 --> 00:01:02,650
There is no retribution in this world
